  <!-- EN: RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection_Completed -->
  <RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.RKU_CheckOnceEvent.eventKey.slateRef>RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection_Completed</RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.RKU_CheckOnceEvent.eventKey.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Interception force approaching -->
  <RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.Delay-0.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterLabel.value.slateRef>拦截部队接近中</RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.Delay-0.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterLabel.value.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Hostile forces are approaching [map_definite] to intercept the guerrilla operative! -->
  <RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.Delay-0.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterText.value.slateRef>敌对势力正在接近[map_definite]来拦截游击队特工！</RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.Delay-0.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterText.value.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Second interception force -->
  <RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.Delay-1.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterLabel.value.slateRef>第二波拦截部队</RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.Delay-1.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterLabel.value.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Another hostile force has been detected approaching [map_definite]! -->
  <RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.Delay-1.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterText.value.slateRef>另一股敌对势力已被侦察到正在接近[map_definite]！</RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.Delay-1.node.nodes.Util_Raid.parms.customLetterText.value.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Departing on foot -->
  <RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.Delay-2.node.nodes.InspectString.inspectString.slateRef>步行离开</RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.Delay-2.node.nodes.InspectString.inspectString.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Mission completed -->
  <RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.Delay-2.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>任务完成</RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.Delay-2.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The guerrilla operative has successfully completed the transmission and departed on foot. Before leaving, [asker_pronoun] revealed that the intelligence concerns certain kingdoms' war crimes and atrocities committed against the ratkin people. -->
  <RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.Delay-2.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>游击队特工已成功完成情报传输并步行离开。离开前，[asker_pronoun]透露情报涉及某些王国对鼠族人民犯下的人体实验罪行。</RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.Delay-2.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Guerrilla operative killed -->
  <RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.askerDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>游击队特工被杀</RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.askerDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The guerrilla operative carrying critical intelligence has been killed. The valuable information has been lost. -->
  <RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.askerDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>携带关键情报的游击队特工已被杀死。宝贵的信息已丢失。</RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.askerDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Unauthorized surgery: {SUBJECT_definite} -->
  <RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.askerSurgeryViolation.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>未经授权的手术：{SUBJECT_definite}</RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.askerSurgeryViolation.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Unauthorized surgery has been performed on the guerrilla operative. The mission has been compromised. -->
  <RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.askerSurgeryViolation.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>对游击队特工进行了未经授权的手术。任务已被破坏。</RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.askerSurgeryViolation.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Operative arrested -->
  <RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.askerArrested.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>特工被捕</RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.askerArrested.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The guerrilla operative has been arrested. The intelligence has been compromised. -->
  <RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.askerArrested.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>游击队特工已被逮捕。情报已被破坏。</RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.askerArrested.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection_Completed -->
  <RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.askerLeftMap.node.nodes.RKU_RecordOnceEvent.eventKey.slateRef>RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection_Completed</RKU_GuerrillaSecretProtection.root.nodes.askerLeftMap.node.nodes.RKU_RecordOnceEvent.eventKey.slateRef>
  
